      "reason": "The manuscript specifies eligible study characteristics: geographical setting (all regional states of Ethiopia), eligible outcomes (prevalence/proportion/incidence of SSI after cesarean section and/or associated factors), and eligible study designs (all observational designs including case-control and cross-sectional)."
